rag is a technique that combines the information retrieveal with the language genration , where model retuireves the relvent documents from a knowlegde base and then uses them as a context to genrate the accurate and grounded respones 


benefits
* use of up to date data 
* better privacy 
* no limit of document size

components of rag:
* document loaders
* text splitters
* vector databases
* Retrievers

# document loaders    
  Document loaders are the components in langchain used to load_data from varius sources into a standardized format (usually as document objects ) which can be used for chunking , embedding , retrieval , genration
  eg--: Document(
    page_content="the actual text content",
    metadata={"source":"filename.pdf",....}
  )

types :--

**** textloader --> textloader is the simple and commonly used document loader in langchain that reads plain text (.txt) files and converts them into langchain document loaders 

use case :
ideal for loading chat logs , scraped text , transcripts , code snippets or any plain text data into langchain pipeline

limitation : 
works only with .txt files


